Title: Literature Review — Incremental Sheet Hydroforming (2015–2025)

Authors / Compiled by: [Your name]
Date: 2026-09-13

1. Executive summary
This document summarizes peer‑reviewed research and review articles from 2015–2025 on Incremental Sheet Hydroforming (ISH/ISHF). Focus areas: process fundamentals, materials and forming limits, process parameters, FEM and multiscale modeling, and recent advances including hybrid and adaptive control methods.

